these Centrus talking points.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:37.800
You know, things like Bernie wants to go too
far or you know, Warren and Bernie's plans

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.400
would never work.

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:40.990
